A month has passed since the shipping container full of equipment and supplies set off for Ecuador. The container will arrive in the port of Guayaquil soon. After clearing all customs formalities, the final leg of the journey can begin — crossing the Andes towards the jungle.

At Hospital San Miguel, everyone is eagerly awaiting the arrival of all the much-needed equipment and supplies.

